WEBVTT

00:00:00.372 --> 00:00:08.308
The Team Board is a shared board for planning and running a team’s work. In this video, you’ll plan a backlog and move work across the board.

00:00:09.347 --> 00:00:18.563
Open Team Board, and pick a team. The Backlog lists everything that’s waiting, so you can plan what comes next, and group it into sprints if you work that way.

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:25.627
Kanban Board shows the same tickets by stage. Drag a card to the next column as the work moves on.

00:00:26.647 --> 00:00:34.007
Filter by person, ticket type, or priority to focus on one part of the work. Every card opens the full ticket.
